      "content": "Wait, what do you mean by \"goblins descending upon your warehouse\"? That's a weird analogy for a demand surge. Can we just stick to the math? \n\nI need to finish the safety stock formula. You were saying something about a 95% service level—how do I actually calculate that buffer for the battery cells, specifically handling the variability in shipping times from Shenzhen?",
